  (text "Keyboard cable (as seen from the keyboard):\n  3 +5V red, 6 GND black\n  9 TRANS+ brown, 4 TRANS- yellow  (keyboard -> host, 2400 baud)\n  7 REC+ blue,   2 REC- white      (host -> keyboard, 600 baud)\n  1, 5, 8 not fitted in the keyboard plug"
    (at 200.66 124.46 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "581447a0-8a71-5c86-8a23-c04c72da1a6f")
  )
  (text "C1: as close as possible to U2 pins 1 and 4.\nF1: fit a wire link. A 500 mA polyfuse drops too much voltage\n(keyboard needs >= 4.75 V; it is held in reset below ~4.65 V).\nNo termination resistor needed at 2400 baud."
    (at 120.65 152.4 0)
